  "timeline": [
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 1,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_0e3002d3b68b42288989aa907534b42c",
        "scene_id": "scn_e6447b9b542e4e5f8a49fc1b669248ff",
        "seq": 1,
        "actor_id": "agt_b3a7589d79ad453e86d34f734416ac7d",
        "text": "先把东西分一下类吧。帐篷和地钉放一边，炊具和食材放另一边，苏木你帮我清点食材，涂山你跟我搭帐篷。天快黑了，争取一个小时内把主帐立起来。",
        "reply_to_message_id": null,
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:57.156974Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "何澜"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 2,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_11dd4f414d32495c842fdc6612a419d4",
        "scene_id": "scn_e6447b9b542e4e5f8a49fc1b669248ff",
        "seq": 2,
        "actor_id": "agt_850d79e34b074bd4bb79b24c2cb5ed64",
        "text": "哎好！食材交给我吧！不过……何澜，搭帐篷我其实也想跟着学两手，行不行？我清单可以快一点，清完就过来帮忙！",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_0e3002d3b68b42288989aa907534b42c",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_b3a7589d79ad453e86d34f734416ac7d",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:58.306598Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "苏木"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 3,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_fc1f75142036416cb1671365acf4b680",
        "scene_id": "scn_e6447b9b542e4e5f8a49fc1b669248ff",
        "seq": 3,
        "actor_id": "agt_b3a7589d79ad453e86d34f734416ac7d",
        "text": "行，清完食材你再过来。涂山，先把帐杆按长短分出来，我扶你穿。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_11dd4f414d32495c842fdc6612a419d4",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:59.469308Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "何澜"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 4,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_47db34db13e24d50a4e18528604b2fe5",
        "scene_id": "scn_e6447b9b542e4e5f8a49fc1b669248ff",
        "seq": 4,
        "actor_id": "agt_56b6545a6e744f03a538b6a8b85371ed",
        "text": "杆我分好了。你扶着，我来穿。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_fc1f75142036416cb1671365acf4b680",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:00.574161Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "涂山"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 5,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_79efe566530e453dac86a6bc869fcb45",
        "scene_id": "scn_e6447b9b542e4e5f8a49fc1b669248ff",
        "seq": 5,
        "actor_id": "agt_850d79e34b074bd4bb79b24c2cb5ed64",
        "text": "好嘞，食材我马上清！何澜，那个……帐杆有分颜色吗？我看网上说有的杆要对号入座，我清完就过来学穿杆啊！",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_fc1f75142036416cb1671365acf4b680",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:01.457837Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "苏木"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 6,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_72b9f2f16626433689d85a8bafe5c9a4",
        "scene_id": "scn_e6447b9b542e4e5f8a49fc1b669248ff",
        "seq": 6,
        "actor_id": "agt_b3a7589d79ad453e86d34f734416ac7d",
        "text": "涂山，颜色不用管，这套杆不分色，只看长短和接口弧度。苏木你先清食材，清完过来我教你看杆序。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_79efe566530e453dac86a6bc869fcb45",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:02.845118Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "何澜"
    },
    {
      "kind": "event",
      "seq": 7,
      "message": null,
      "event": {
        "body": "营地广播提醒风正在变大，天黑前需要检查帐篷固定。大家可以自行决定怎么安排。",
        "visibility": "ALL",
        "target_agent_id": null,
        "event_id": "evt_55cc13e499cb4cf8ac01f6b417a4a134",
        "scene_id": "scn_e6447b9b542e4e5f8a49fc1b669248ff",
        "seq": 7,
        "status": "EFFECTIVE",
        "schema_version": 1,
        "accepted_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:04.268738Z",
