      "author_name": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 8,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_e86bce6048cb45b9899988708344185f",
        "scene_id": "scn_e6447b9b542e4e5f8a49fc1b669248ff",
        "seq": 8,
        "actor_id": "agt_56b6545a6e744f03a538b6a8b85371ed",
        "text": "杆穿好了。风大，我去把迎风那侧的绳先打上。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_72b9f2f16626433689d85a8bafe5c9a4",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:04.290194Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "涂山"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 9,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_b15d633bc4a74120a6076d809016888f",
        "scene_id": "scn_e6447b9b542e4e5f8a49fc1b669248ff",
        "seq": 9,
        "actor_id": "agt_850d79e34b074bd4bb79b24c2cb5ed64",
        "text": "食材清好了！何澜我这就过来！风这么大，是不是得先打地钉再穿杆啊？还有迎风那边我要不要帮忙拉绳——涂山你等我，我也想学打结！",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_e86bce6048cb45b9899988708344185f",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_b3a7589d79ad453e86d34f734416ac7d",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:05.256144Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "苏木"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 10,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_dbf5d6cf04e44260a44987fb616db595",
        "scene_id": "scn_e6447b9b542e4e5f8a49fc1b669248ff",
        "seq": 10,
        "actor_id": "agt_b3a7589d79ad453e86d34f734416ac7d",
        "text": "苏木，地钉等杆立起来再打，先别急。涂山迎风绳打得好，你先过去跟涂山把那个结看清楚，回来再学穿杆序。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_b15d633bc4a74120a6076d809016888f",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_850d79e34b074bd4bb79b24c2cb5ed64",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:06.909245Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "何澜"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 11,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_dd88d978e9244149be871364e53ee18a",
        "scene_id": "scn_e6447b9b542e4e5f8a49fc1b669248ff",
        "seq": 11,
        "actor_id": "agt_850d79e34b074bd4bb79b24c2cb5ed64",
        "text": "好！我先过去看涂山打结——那个迎风绳的结难不难啊？我手笨但学得快！",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_dbf5d6cf04e44260a44987fb616db595",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_56b6545a6e744f03a538b6a8b85371ed",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:08.054739Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "苏木"
    },
    {
      "kind": "event",
      "seq": 12,
      "message": null,
      "event": {
        "body": "只有你收到营地短信：河边步道即将临时关闭，其他人暂时不知道。",
