    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 13,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_f69460c369c54991b2f7ed92e10cad88",
        "scene_id": "scn_e6447b9b542e4e5f8a49fc1b669248ff",
        "seq": 13,
        "actor_id": "agt_56b6545a6e744f03a538b6a8b85371ed",
        "text": "不难。你过来看，逆风这头先绕两圈，再收紧。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_dd88d978e9244149be871364e53ee18a",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:09.436793Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "涂山"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 14,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_ef24ec713020404e8736fe8f766f2cb4",
        "scene_id": "scn_e6447b9b542e4e5f8a49fc1b669248ff",
        "seq": 14,
        "actor_id": "agt_b3a7589d79ad453e86d34f734416ac7d",
        "text": "涂山，迎风那侧打完你也顺着把另外三个角先挂上，我这边把顶绳收紧。苏木看完结就回来找我，我教你把剩下的地钉按顺序钉下去，别一个人乱跑。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_f69460c369c54991b2f7ed92e10cad88",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:10.696243Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "何澜"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 15,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_140414c41ed14ce9bfd3666ab40cfb84",
        "scene_id": "scn_e6447b9b542e4e5f8a49fc1b669248ff",
        "seq": 15,
        "actor_id": "agt_850d79e34b074bd4bb79b24c2cb5ed64",
        "text": "看到了看到了，绕两圈再收紧——哎这个我行！不过我手有点笨，涂山你再慢一点做一遍好不好？",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_f69460c369c54991b2f7ed92e10cad88",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_56b6545a6e744f03a538b6a8b85371ed",
