        "seq": 16,
        "actor_id": "agt_56b6545a6e744f03a538b6a8b85371ed",
        "text": "再看一遍。绕两圈，收紧。我慢点做。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_140414c41ed14ce9bfd3666ab40cfb84",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:12.975286Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "涂山"
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "actor": "何澜",
      "action_id": "act_dbb7773d9d0a40ea95ac11befde57a11",
      "actor_id": "agt_b3a7589d79ad453e86d34f734416ac7d",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "先把东西分一下类吧。帐篷和地钉放一边，炊具和食材放另一边，苏木你帮我清点食材，涂山你跟我搭帐篷。天快黑了，争取一个小时内把主帐立起来。",
      "reply_to_message_id": null,
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 0,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "3c3e789f-08c9-459c-8bfa-84255b2cc10f",
      "input_tokens": 526,
      "output_tokens": 80,
      "cached_tokens": 0,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1112,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:57.156974+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:58.274769+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "苏木",
      "action_id": "act_8fec2ca314bb49e4b62688de2ff0e5a0",
      "actor_id": "agt_850d79e34b074bd4bb79b24c2cb5ed64",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "哎好！食材交给我吧！不过……何澜，搭帐篷我其实也想跟着学两手，行不行？我清单可以快一点，清完就过来帮忙！",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_0e3002d3b68b42288989aa907534b42c",
      "requested_speaker_id": "agt_b3a7589d79ad453e86d34f734416ac7d",
      "input_cursor_seq": 1,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "e909ea2d-5c74-4210-b52d-b1799cb6976c",
      "input_tokens": 587,
      "output_tokens": 108,
      "cached_tokens": 0,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1128,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:58.306598+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:59.439793+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "何澜",
      "action_id": "act_f904b5861e3e44299e0ad0ea9ac8732a",
      "actor_id": "agt_b3a7589d79ad453e86d34f734416ac7d",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "行，清完食材你再过来。涂山，先把帐杆按长短分出来，我扶你穿。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_11dd4f414d32495c842fdc6612a419d4",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 2,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "487d231e-36c7-4ea4-8689-a4020d236608",
      "input_tokens": 669,
      "output_tokens": 75,
      "cached_tokens": 0,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1080,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:59.469308+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:00.553820+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "涂山",
      "action_id": "act_711dfc40074a410b8cd5137164e003bc",
      "actor_id": "agt_56b6545a6e744f03a538b6a8b85371ed",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "杆我分好了。你扶着，我来穿。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_fc1f75142036416cb1671365acf4b680",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 3,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "7bcd69c7-26f4-4ebc-98f7-b9b094c898c3",
      "input_tokens": 718,
      "output_tokens": 60,
      "cached_tokens": 0,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 727,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:00.574161+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:01.316925+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "苏木",
      "action_id": "act_a6a8d721cf5c4df4bc30b21f7a6c9bf0",
      "actor_id": "agt_850d79e34b074bd4bb79b24c2cb5ed64",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "好嘞，食材我马上清！何澜，那个……帐杆有分颜色吗？我看网上说有的杆要对号入座，我清完就过来学穿杆啊！",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_fc1f75142036416cb1671365acf4b680",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 4,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "0c71e310-759f-4882-b4f8-226c1c446d6a",
      "input_tokens": 749,
      "output_tokens": 90,
      "cached_tokens": 128,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1346,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:01.457837+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:02.810314+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "何澜",
      "action_id": "act_6a993be977c94a7fa5d354f1e7114882",
      "actor_id": "agt_b3a7589d79ad453e86d34f734416ac7d",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "涂山，颜色不用管，这套杆不分色，只看长短和接口弧度。苏木你先清食材，清完过来我教你看杆序。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_79efe566530e453dac86a6bc869fcb45",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 5,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "c48abf78-f580-4148-9879-38431048be3e",
      "input_tokens": 828,
      "output_tokens": 82,
      "cached_tokens": 128,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1404,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:02.845118+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:04.254652+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "涂山",
      "action_id": "act_b254b3ccf94d4c9da73eef93796693fa",
      "actor_id": "agt_56b6545a6e744f03a538b6a8b85371ed",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "杆穿好了。风大，我去把迎风那侧的绳先打上。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_72b9f2f16626433689d85a8bafe5c9a4",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 7,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "38c09660-6c5a-4401-b486-ab665c612f6c",
      "input_tokens": 920,
      "output_tokens": 72,
      "cached_tokens": 256,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 941,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:04.290194+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:05.235294+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "苏木",
      "action_id": "act_d4c27750a2d8478eb7f8d77e0b04e0fc",
      "actor_id": "agt_850d79e34b074bd4bb79b24c2cb5ed64",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "食材清好了！何澜我这就过来！风这么大，是不是得先打地钉再穿杆啊？还有迎风那边我要不要帮忙拉绳——涂山你等我，我也想学打结！",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_e86bce6048cb45b9899988708344185f",
      "requested_speaker_id": "agt_b3a7589d79ad453e86d34f734416ac7d",
      "input_cursor_seq": 8,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "2506edef-da13-42a9-ae92-d4d237374f22",
      "input_tokens": 954,
      "output_tokens": 112,
      "cached_tokens": 256,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1624,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:05.256144+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:06.883345+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "何澜",
      "action_id": "act_71913bdc7b4742c39d1653a43568a596",
      "actor_id": "agt_b3a7589d79ad453e86d34f734416ac7d",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "苏木，地钉等杆立起来再打，先别急。涂山迎风绳打得好，你先过去跟涂山把那个结看清楚，回来再学穿杆序。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_b15d633bc4a74120a6076d809016888f",
      "requested_speaker_id": "agt_850d79e34b074bd4bb79b24c2cb5ed64",
      "input_cursor_seq": 9,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "fbab7206-a93d-41aa-824e-c2dc462841b7",
      "input_tokens": 1041,
      "output_tokens": 111,
      "cached_tokens": 384,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1108,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:06.909245+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:08.022824+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "苏木",
      "action_id": "act_5877dc1b571d4564ad5aa40124dff159",
      "actor_id": "agt_850d79e34b074bd4bb79b24c2cb5ed64",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "好！我先过去看涂山打结——那个迎风绳的结难不难啊？我手笨但学得快！",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_dbf5d6cf04e44260a44987fb616db595",
      "requested_speaker_id": "agt_56b6545a6e744f03a538b6a8b85371ed",
      "input_cursor_seq": 10,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "98da8b2f-1f07-449a-a567-9a28eee3a3a3",
      "input_tokens": 1102,
      "output_tokens": 98,
      "cached_tokens": 512,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1316,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:08.054739+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:09.376653+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "涂山",
      "action_id": "act_3b35b9099ad94ff0b967eeab0b4f680b",
      "actor_id": "agt_56b6545a6e744f03a538b6a8b85371ed",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "不难。你过来看，逆风这头先绕两圈，再收紧。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_dd88d978e9244149be871364e53ee18a",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 11,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "b9296e1f-84b1-49b4-b7fe-8d9e1d9c8fdb",
      "input_tokens": 1171,
      "output_tokens": 67,
      "cached_tokens": 384,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1227,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:09.436793+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:10.667518+00:00"
    },
